Subject: Re: How to perform MGCFA using Lavaan when we have groups of variables and not two different categories.
Message-ID: <ybADJRF6o9k.DHHcU6h8AgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ybADJRF6o9k.77GRvNUFCAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <ybADJRF6o9k.tHfs-b-iBwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com> <ybADJRF6o9k.77GRvNUFCAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
