As a supplementary remark to Pat.
Basically you can also bootstrap with MLR. For example, by using the boot package. However, this is pointless. First, the procedure takes much longer. Second, the results do not differ, since MLR corrects the s.e. and the chi square. Both are irrelevant for your problem, since only the point estimates are needed.

--
