Thanks, in that case I have two choices:
1. MLM + MCMC (as you said MLM + Bootstrap can be done, but doesn't make sense)
2. ML + Bootstrap

I am keen on using MLM, so probably option 1 suits me better despite it being not a much common choice in my field, however what I am really interested in knowing is that whether going with this combination will lead to counter questions from reviewers on why did I use this or why I did not go with option 2?
Looking forward to your comments.

