Subject: Re: the optimizer (NLMINB) claimed the model converged, but...
Message-ID: <ASycfFKS56g.Wbc2ifPkAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ASycfFKS56g.4hS8uKSzAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
